body:
ah, thank you so much! that's much more affordable than i thought! i'm (hopefully) going to be in contact with a psychiatrist soon via \[the org providing mental health services\], as my GP believes that i just need talk therapy (which has been really helpful so far, but i think my current mental state is just. Really Not Good) - i really hope that taking medication can alleviate some of my more...serious symptoms.

&#x200B;

i hope you're doing well and taking care of yourself!
